# strat       total_Y_delta   n_cells_underspending  mean_per_cell   min
# DCT16X16   -6815           7/7                    -973.6          -1331
# DCT16X8    -2006           7/7                    -286.6          -401
# DCT8       -1521           7/7                    -217.3          -290
